+++ b/docs/runbooks/2026-11-kb-operator-ingest.md
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+# KB operator ingest (D16, ENABLE_OPERATOR_INGEST)
+
+The operator captures a merchant product page in their OWN browser and posts the
+captured payload to the admin API. The page itself is never fetched by the app.
+
+## 1. The bookmarklet (copies one JSON object to the clipboard; it never posts)
+
+```
+javascript:(function(){var j=[];document.querySelectorAll('script[type="application/ld+json"]').forEach(function(s){try{var d=JSON.parse(s.textContent);(Array.isArray(d)?d:[d]).forEach(function(x){if(j.length<20)j.push(x);});}catch(e){}});var og=document.querySelector('meta[property="og:image"]');var p={source:"operator",page_url:location.href,jsonld:j,og_image:og?og.content:null};navigator.clipboard.writeText(JSON.stringify(p));})();
+```
+
+Add `price`, `size_ml`, `in_stock` and manual `specs` to the copied JSON by hand when
+the page does not carry them. Licence fields (notes_top, notes_heart, notes_base,
+longevity, sillage) are accepted only with `"source": "partner"`.
+
+## 2. Post it (the key comes from the environment variable name only)
+
+```
+curl -X POST "$API_BASE/api/v1/admin/kb/ingest" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -H "X-Admin-Key: $ADMIN_API_KEY" --data @payload.json
+```
+
+## 3. The view
+
+`GET /api/v1/admin/kb/operator?limit=50` with the same `X-Admin-Key` header lists the
+blocked registry hosts, the needs_operator gaps and the latest coverage day.
